he right arrow","action":{"kind":"press","key":"ArrowRight"},"assertions":[{"kind":"focus","selector":"a[href='#past-week']"}]},{"title":"Press the left arrow","action":{"kind":"press","key":"ArrowLeft"},"assertions":[{"kind":"focus","selector":"a[href='#past-day']"}]}],"success":[{"kind":"visible","selector":"#past-day","value":true}],"functional":[{"kind":"attribute","selector":"a[href='#past-day']","name":"aria-selected","value":"true"}],"forbidden":[]}],"guardsHash":"0ce0e22e662ac05fe3237c0a512eeafe50090389bc92401c2d10d86117a73ce0","attempts":[{"attempt":1,"startedAt":"2026-10-26T13:22:12.964Z","verified":true,"category":null,"plan":{"root_cause":"The onTabKeydown handler treats ArrowDown and ArrowUp as navigation between tabs, causing vertical arrow keys to change the selected tab in a horizontal tablist, contrary to the expected behavior where only left/right arrows move between tabs.","repair_strategy":"Modify the onTabKeydown method to respond only to ArrowLeft/Left and ArrowRight/Right (and their legacy key names), ignoring ArrowUp/Down and Up/Down, thus making vertical arrow keys no-ops for the tablist while preserving horizontal navigation.","edits":[{"path":"packages/govuk-frontend/src/govuk/components/tabs/tabs.js","sha256":"efec2dbc261636f1987a68ade80173d751d99359fe13cc0106084220e96e3698","before":"  /**\n   * Handle tab keydown event\n   *\n   * - Press right/down arrow for next tab\n   * - Press left/up arrow for previous tab\n   *\n   * @private\n   * @param {KeyboardEvent} event - Keydown event\n   */\n  onTabKeydown(event) {\n    switch (event.key) {\n      // 'Left', 'Right', 'Up' and 'Down' required for Edge 16 support.\n      case 'ArrowLeft':\n      case 'ArrowUp':\n      case 'Left':\n      case 'Up':\n        this.activatePreviousTab()\n        event.preventDefault()\n        break\n      case 'ArrowRight':\n      case 'ArrowDown':\n      case 'Right':\n      case 'Down':\n        this.activateNextTab()\n        event.preventDefault()\n        break\n    }\n  }","after":"  /**\n   * Handle tab keydown event\n   *\n   * - Press right/left arrow for next/previous tab\n   *\n   * @private\n   * @param {KeyboardEvent} event - Keydown event\n   */\n  onTabKeydown(event) {\n    switch (event.key) {\n      // 'Left' and 'Right' required for Edge 16 support.\n      case 'ArrowLeft':\n      case 'Left':\n        this.activatePreviousTab()\n        event.preventDefault()\n        break\n      case 'ArrowRight':\n      case 'Right':\n        this.activateNextTab()\n        event.preventDefault()\n        break\n    }\n  }"}],"expected_accessibility_effect":"Users can press the Down arrow without changing the selected tab, keeping the current tab panel visible; keyboard navigation remains operable via left/right arrows, conforming to ARIA authoring practices for a horizontal tablist.","functional_risks":["Removing vertical arrow navigation may affect users who expect Up/DOWN to move focus in a vertical tablist, but this component is used only for horizontal tablists as per the supplied CSS.","Legacy Edge support for Up/DOWN keys is dropped, but LEFT/RIGHT keys remain supported."],"verification_requirements":["Pressing ArrowDown does not change focus or aria-selected attribute; the selected tab and its panel remain unchanged.","Pressing ArrowRight moves focus to the next tab, updates aria-selected, and shows the corresponding panel.","Pressing ArrowLeft moves focus to the previous tab, updates aria-selected, and shows the corresponding panel.","No JavaScript errors are thrown when pressing ArrowUp or ArrowDown.","Page scroll is not affected by ArrowUp/Down key presses."]},"provenance":{"provider":"Nebius Token Factory","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","requestId":"chatcmpl-a00d3e4897c06fc3894ca9fdb0c00d92","promptHash":"170acbec018c3ef97182fc92ec4190135eb939a35c86b4bc1a8f617d48d147a0","schemaVersion":2,"structuredOutput":false,"latencyMs":17703,"usage":{"completion_tokens":3869,"prompt_tokens":10760,"tot